  "instructions": [
    "Combine the Gigantes beans, onion, garlic, parsley, oregano, salt, and pepper in a sous-vide bag.",
    "Add the Shaoxing wine and olive oil to the bag, sealing it tightly.",
    "Cook the beans sous-vide at 190°F (88°C) for 4 hours.",
    "After cooking, heat the bean mixture in a saucepan over medium heat until heated through.",
    "Serve the Gigantes beans hot, topped with crumbled feta cheese if desired."
